flowchart TB
  Hosting[Vercel hosting target: static build + SPA rewrite] --> UI[React interface + React Router]
  Images[Unsplash remote editorial images] --> UI
  subgraph Browser[Browser-local application]
    UI --> Variants[ProductInfo: exact color/size selection]
    Catalog[Typed local catalog] --> Variants
    Catalog --> Cart[Zustand cart: stock caps + derived totals]
    Variants --> Cart
    UI --> UIState[Zustand UI state: cart visibility]
    Cart <--> Storage[localStorage: guarded persist + reconciliation]
    UIState --> CartView[CartSidebar overlay]
    CartView -->|open-checkout event| Checkout[CheckoutModal: local steps and form state]
    Cart --> Checkout
    Checkout --> Zod[Zod: validation + inferred delivery type]
    Zod -->|valid details| Result[Review and completion preview]
  end
  Boundary[No commerce API, database, payment, authentication or email delivery]
